L000802	The next two results, Theorem \ref{th:GCO_PI_app} (a reiteration of Theorem \ref{th:GCO_PI} in the main text) and Lemma~\ref{le:free_dilation_app} relate to what properties we can infer from a Gaussian covariant operation that admits a particular fixed point dilation.
