L000890	Lastly, we present a powerful technical lemma that helps simplify much of our analysis.
L000891	This lemma decomposes a Gaussian covariant channel into two parts.
L000892	The parts depend on the fixed-point of the GCO, in particular the off-diagonal part of the fixed-point $\chi$.
