L001257	\subsection{Monotonicity under correlated catalysis (P4 in main text)}
L001258	The next two lemmas address how our GCO monotones behave under correlated catalytic transformations. Firstly, we again prove that without loss of generality, the catalyst state can be characterized by some $\tilde{\mu}_{C'}>\frac{\iden}{2}$.
