L001288	The initial states of $S$ and $C$ are labeled as $(\mu_S,\chi_S)$ and $(\mu_C,\chi_C)$ respectively. After the action of a GCO $(A,B)$, the reduced states becomes $(\mu'_S,\chi'_S)$ and $(\mu'_C,\chi'_C)$.
