L001291	Lemma~\ref{lemma: Slpm takagi} singles out vectors $\psi$ achieving the optimal value for each $\Sl_\pm(\mu_C',\chi_C')$.
L001292	This vector can be regarded as the most asymmetric mode $C(\psi)$ among catalyst modes $C$ in some basis.
